  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Hello, I'm Ian, a messenger of Temskron.",
      "",
      "As you have seen, weird things are going on in the ",
      "Priston Continent. We have determined it to ",
      "be a crack of space-time. Royal Mage is looking for",
      "the solution. Huge monsters like Pagon of ",
      "Igol Ranos comes from the crack of space-time.",
      "There are more people who have seen these ",
      "monsters.",
      "",
      "For protection against these monsters, people are",
      "manufacturing C-stone. However, the current C-stone",
      "form is too weak to offer protection. Can you gather ",
      "monsters' specimens for materials of C-stone?"
    ]
  },
